  "body": "See https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5894#discussion_r486682410. Quoting:\r\n\r\n> when we initially added that section to the spec, we didn't have the CSS value we needed to map into. That value was added later, and we should update the spec to define it maps to `aspect-ratio: <width> / <height> auto` instead of changing the definition of \"intrinsic aspect ratio\".",
